  "note": "Patcher matrix for B192, BUILT FROM main AT 12382b8 (PR #359), seeded from the B191 matrix. Four owner-requested changes. (1) The three career-room goals (Cozy Kitchen 0x36, Office of the future 0x37, Workshop 0x38) are recomputed from owned upgrades after the save loads and after the Reset Achievements cheat, using the game's own CTech::Level, because the stock game only recomputes them on an upgrade purchase and a reset while every upgrade is owned left them at zero forever; confirmed in play on a probe build. (2) A fifth child-discipline goal, No banging dishes together! (0xAB, exact native label \"Banging dishes!\"), counting towards Props to you at both of its decision sites. (3) Every EVENT that spawns a collectable -- the mobile fossil email and the native Bug Whisperer and Neighbor Collectible -- now replaces the oldest unpicked collectable when both of CCollectableItem's two event slots are busy (a free slot is always used first), because the native Add returns without spawning in that state; confirmed live on a probe build with both slots occupied. (4) The two Cheat Upgrades spawn rows spawn fifteen each, evenly split: 5 dirt smudges, 5 socks and 5 wrappers, and 15 weeds cycling all four weed types, through the native spawners. See docs/B192-release-notes.md, which must not be allowed to disagree with this field.",
